### READ

GET http://localhost/hotel/{{hotelId}}
Accept: application/json

###

GET http://localhost/hotel/{{hotelId}}/html
Accept: text/html

###

GET http://localhost/hotel/{{hotelId}}/csv
Accept: text/csv

### READ ALL

GET http://localhost/hotel
Accept: application/json

###

