### UPDATE

PUT http://localhost/hotel/{{hotelId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "name": "Hotel Sunshine Updated",
  "address": "456 Second St, Kyiv",
  "ownerId": "{{ownerId}}",
  "roomCount": 60
}

